{"id": "united-playaz-soma-fund", "title": "A nonprofit director sits on the City panel that recommends its funding", "seconds": 130.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.185, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "6b2f47315ed079d5", "words": 410, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "In SoMa, developers of new housing pay a fee into a fund,", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.43, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "South of Market", "hoodLabel": "SoMa", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "kicker": "SoMa Community Stabilization Fund"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.65, 1.07, 1.19, 1.34, 1.73, 1.9, 2.02, 2.22, 2.47, 2.57]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "the SoMa Community Stabilization Fund.", "t0": 3.43, "t1": 5.55, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "hood": "South of Market", "hoodLabel": "SoMa", "zoom": "hood", "scale": 2.6, "kicker": "SoMa Community Stabilization Fund"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.18, 0.48, 0.97, 1.66]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "A seven-seat committee advises the City on how to spend it.", "t0": 5.67, "t1": 8.18, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Community Advisory Committee", "sub": "seven seats; advises on how the fund is spent"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.51, 0.88, 1.38, 1.53, 1.76, 1.92, 2.05, 2.14, 2.39]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "Since March 2020, one member has been Misha Olivas.", "t0": 8.3, "t1": 11.41, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Community Advisory Committee", "sub": "seven seats; advises on how the fund is spent"}, "emph": ["Misha Olivas"], "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.71, 1.18, 1.33, 1.67, 1.85, 2.03, 2.39]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "She also works for United Playaz, a SoMa nonprofit the fund pays.", "t0": 11.53, "t1": 14.77, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "United Playaz", "sub": "Director of Community and Family Engagement", "chip": "salary over $100,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.5, 0.65, 0.98, 1.54, 1.65, 1.93, 2.45, 2.61, 2.89]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]"], "text": "Every year, her disclosures list a salary over 100,000 dollars.", "t0": 14.89, "t1": 18.78, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "United Playaz", "sub": "Director of Community and Family Engagement", "chip": "salary over $100,000"}, "emph": ["over 100,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.51, 0.66, 1.21, 1.46, 1.56, 2.02, 2.3, 2.54, 2.89, 3.36]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 18.9, "t1": 20.54, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.3, 0.41, 0.97, 1.18, 1.3]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "In October 2022, the committee recommended money for four building projects.", "t0": 20.76, "t1": 24.95, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "1044 Howard St", "kicker": "October 20, 2022", "sub": "next door to the United Playaz clubhouse"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.48, 0.74, 1.47, 1.55, 1.9, 2.43, 2.65, 2.87, 3.18, 3.54]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "One was for United Playaz, to buy 1044 Howard Street. How much?", "t0": 25.07, "t1": 29.25, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "1044 Howard St", "kicker": "October 20, 2022", "sub": "next door to the United Playaz clubhouse"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.37, 0.52, 0.86, 1.53, 1.67, 1.87, 2.08, 2.62, 3.01, 3.53, 3.85]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "1,115,470 dollars.", "t0": 29.25, "t1": 31.63, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,115,470", "label": "SoMa Fund money recommended for United Playaz"}, "emph": ["1,115,470"], "wt": [0.04, 0.6, 0.79, 1.09, 1.36, 1.89]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "She’s paid by the group the money went to.", "t0": 31.75, "t1": 33.58, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "members of advisory bodies must generally stay out of contract advice that affects an organization they are tied to"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.52, 0.62, 0.72, 0.96, 1.06, 1.31, 1.51]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "The City Attorney has advised such members to stay out of decisions like this.", "t0": 33.7, "t1": 37.08, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "members of advisory bodies must generally stay out of contract advice that affects an organization they are tied to"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.17, 0.52, 0.72, 1.05, 1.27, 1.64, 1.76, 2.09, 2.34, 2.47, 2.88, 3.09]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "Did she step aside? The minutes weren’t found.", "t0": 37.2, "t1": 39.35, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "408", "label": "recusal notices on file; none from this committee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.21, 0.39, 1.02, 1.23, 1.49, 1.73]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "And of 408 recusal notices on file, none comes from this committee.", "t0": 39.47, "t1": 43.49, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "408", "label": "recusal notices on file; none from this committee"}, "emph": ["none"], "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.2, 0.4, 0.68, 0.97, 1.42, 1.76, 1.91, 2.59, 2.93, 3.29, 3.43, 3.57]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]", "innocent[1]"], "text": "To be clear: three City staff, not the committee, scored the bids.", "t0": 43.61, "t1": 47.07, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Scored by MOHCD staff", "sub": "United Playaz scored highest of five bidders"}, "emph": ["not the committee"], "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.15, 0.69, 0.97, 1.25, 1.83, 1.94, 2.03, 2.64, 2.89, 3.02]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]", "innocent[1]"], "text": "United Playaz scored highest.", "t0": 47.19, "t1": 48.85, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Scored by MOHCD staff", "sub": "United Playaz scored highest of five bidders"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.76, 1.11]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[10]", "story[7]"], "text": "A second member was president of TODCO, a SoMa housing developer.", "t0": 48.97, "t1": 52.3, "shot": "b8b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "TODCO", "sub": "a SoMa housing developer; its president sat on the same committee", "kicker": "A second member"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.33, 0.61, 0.79, 1.14, 1.32, 2.01, 2.11, 2.41, 2.7]}, {"scene": "vote", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[10]"], "text": "Its return records 151,000 dollars to United Playaz, to support purchase of property.", "t0": 52.42, "t1": 58.04, "shot": "b8c", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$151,000", "label": "TODCO grant to United Playaz, year to June 2023", "sub": "“to support purchase of property”"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.59, 1.05, 1.25, 1.59, 1.99, 2.42, 2.92, 3.0, 3.28, 4.0, 4.08, 4.43, 4.92, 5.11]}, {"scene": "sale", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "Then the timing. The Assessor gives the building a sale date of December 7, 2022.", "t0": 58.26, "t1": 63.2, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-12-07", "to": "2023-02-14", "days": null, "fromLab": "Assessor’s sale date", "toLab": "Board votes 11-0", "kicker": "The timing", "toOn": "february"}, "emph": ["December 7, 2022"], "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.45, 0.99, 1.39, 1.79, 2.03, 2.11, 2.39, 2.47, 2.74, 2.98, 3.08, 3.55, 4.07, 4.28]}, {"scene": "sale", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "The Board voted the money on February 14, 2023, 11 to 0.", "t0": 63.32, "t1": 67.61, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-12-07", "to": "2023-02-14", "days": null, "fromLab": "Assessor’s sale date", "toLab": "Board votes 11-0", "kicker": "The timing", "toOn": "february"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.02, 0.35, 0.59, 0.67, 0.91, 1.09, 1.52, 2.15, 2.37, 3.19, 3.61, 3.92]}, {"scene": "sale", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "innocent[2]"], "text": "One reading: the sale closed first, so the Board voted on a done deal.", "t0": 67.73, "t1": 71.35, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-12-07", "to": "2023-02-14", "days": null, "fromLab": "Assessor’s sale date", "toLab": "Board votes 11-0", "kicker": "The timing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.79, 0.88, 1.09, 1.44, 1.97, 2.08, 2.17, 2.45, 2.8, 2.97, 3.06, 3.33]}, {"scene": "sale", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[9]", "story[6]"], "text": "The recorder’s index has the deed to United Playaz recorded on December 7: 69 days before the vote.", "t0": 71.47, "t1": 77.31, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pr1", "kicker": "Recorder’s index · 1044 Howard Street", "text": "deed to United Playaz Inc recorded 2022-12-07 (document 2022109688)", "mark": "2022109688"}, "emph": ["69 days"], "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.53, 0.86, 1.03, 1.15, 1.46, 1.6, 1.93, 2.36, 2.86, 2.95, 3.36, 4.25, 4.82, 5.23, 5.44, 5.58]}, {"scene": "sale", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "innocent[2]", "story[6]"], "text": "Same-day loans, one from the selling trust, point to a buyer closing on borrowed money, repaid by a grant later.", "t0": 77.43, "t1": 83.13, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pr1", "kicker": "Recorder’s index · 1044 Howard Street", "text": "deed to United Playaz Inc recorded 2022-12-07 (document 2022109688)", "mark": "2022109688"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.95, 1.13, 1.26, 1.34, 1.63, 2.08, 2.27, 2.35, 2.43, 2.71, 3.13, 3.31, 3.71, 4.33, 4.75, 4.92, 5.01, 5.36]}, {"scene": "price", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Planned City money came to 3,115,470 dollars,", "t0": 83.35, "t1": 86.64, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["planned City funding", "$3,115,470"], "b": ["expected purchase price", "$2.16 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.44, 0.66, 0.9, 0.99, 1.26, 1.53, 1.81, 2.03, 2.56]}, {"scene": "price", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The expected cost: 2.16 million.", "t0": 86.64, "t1": 89.23, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["planned City funding", "$3,115,470"], "b": ["expected purchase price", "$2.16 million"]}, "emph": ["2.16 million"], "wt": [0.04, 0.14, 0.59, 1.27, 1.43, 1.73, 1.86, 2.16]}, {"scene": "price", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "established[5]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "The rest was said to cover renovation.", "t0": 89.35, "t1": 91.05, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "report the appraised value and final cost within 30 days of the purchase"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.4, 0.54, 0.73, 0.81, 1.03]}, {"scene": "price", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "established[5]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "The Board wanted the appraisal and final price within 30 days. That report wasn’t found.", "t0": 91.17, "t1": 96.05, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "report the appraised value and final cost within 30 days of the purchase"}, "emph": ["wasn’t found"], "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.31, 0.56, 0.66, 1.12, 1.26, 1.56, 1.95, 2.34, 2.66, 3.33, 3.57, 4.0, 4.46]}, {"scene": "others", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "In September 2026, the Ethics Commission fined another member,", "t0": 96.27, "t1": 99.91, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Janetta Johnson", "kicker": "The Ethics Commission", "sub": "fined September 11, 2026", "chip": "$600"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.65, 0.91, 1.64, 1.74, 2.06, 2.47, 2.74, 3.09]}, {"scene": "others", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "Janetta Johnson, 600 dollars.", "t0": 99.91, "t1": 102.07, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Janetta Johnson", "kicker": "The Ethics Commission", "sub": "fined September 11, 2026", "chip": "$600"}, "emph": ["600 dollars"], "wt": [0.04, 0.33, 1.02, 1.26, 1.55]}, {"scene": "others", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "She had voted while disqualified.", "t0": 102.19, "t1": 104.02, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Janetta Johnson", "kicker": "The Ethics Commission", "sub": "fined September 11, 2026", "chip": "$600"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.31, 0.62, 1.07]}, {"scene": "others", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]"], "text": "And a Controller review of United Playaz, in fiscal 2021-22, had no findings.", "t0": 104.14, "t1": 109.57, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Controller monitoring review", "sub": "United Playaz, fiscal year 2021-22", "chip": "no findings"}, "emph": ["no findings"], "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.4, 0.89, 1.28, 1.42, 1.76, 2.34, 2.56, 2.82, 3.03, 3.56, 3.75, 4.28, 4.73, 4.88]}, {"scene": "record", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "Ethics Commission non-filer lists also name SoMa Fund advisory committee members.", "t0": 109.79, "t1": 114.04, "shot": "record-13-2023, 2025 and 2026", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "w25n3", "text": "2023, 2025 and 2026", "mark": "2023, 2025 and 2026", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.61, 1.21, 1.62, 1.94, 2.23, 2.54, 2.76, 3.27, 3.63]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The records don’t show whether Olivas voted. Or how much United Playaz paid.", "t0": 114.26, "t1": 117.92, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Whether Olivas voted on October 20, 2022", "How much United Playaz paid for the building"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.37, 0.6, 0.83, 1.02, 1.48, 1.98, 2.35, 2.54, 2.74, 3.01, 3.31]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The committee’s minutes and roll calls. And the deed, which would show the price.", "t0": 118.04, "t1": 122.66, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Committee minutes and roll calls, October 20, 2022"}, {"who": "", "what": "The December 7, 2022 deed, and the report the Board required"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.18, 0.46, 0.72, 1.05, 1.4, 1.75, 1.93, 2.1, 2.61, 2.94, 3.11, 3.58, 3.73, 3.83, 4.01, 4.13]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "established[1]"], "text": "The Board reappointed her in December 2024. Her term runs to 2027.", "t0": 122.78, "t1": 127.38, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.33, 0.82, 1.05, 1.14, 1.54, 1.81, 2.8, 2.9, 3.19, 3.5, 3.62, 3.84]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.5, "t1": 129.51, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.35, 0.47, 0.55, 1.15, 1.29, 1.43]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The seat", "vote": "Lead 1 · the recommendation", "sale": "Lead 2 · the timing", "price": "Lead 3 · the price", "others": "On the record", "close": "Where it stands", "record": "The public record"}, "look": "map", "hook": "person"}